 "story": "Liverpool won 3-1 away at Selhurst Park against Crystal Palace in the Premier League. Alexis Mac Allister opened the scoring in the 40th minute, assisted by Dominik Szoboszlai, and Florian Wirtz doubled the lead in the 54th minute, set up by Bradley Barcola. Alexander Isak added a third in the 89th minute, assisted by Wirtz, and Eddie Nketiah scored a penalty for Palace in the fifth minute of stoppage time. The win lifts Liverpool from sixth to fourth in the table, with 18 points from 10 matches.",
